    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Cipu Sittu is a merry-go-round with a sea theme. Shark fins rise around the Sky Blue platform, so riders feel as if they are circling in deep water. In the photos a blue water-pattern surface completes the scene. It suits ages 5 to 12. The unit is compact at 5' x 5', with a safe play area of 8'8\" x 8'8\", so it slots into most society gardens and school play areas. Revolving together builds balance, coordination, imagination and cooperative play. It belongs to our Organic Play collection. The galvanised pipes and roto-moulded parts are covered for 3 years, and the bearings for 1 year. Add it to your layout request and we will mark its spinning zone."
     }
